# {{label|en|idiomatic|colloquial}} A person who [[dress]]es in the clothes of another [[sex]], or in clothes which make their gender identity ambiguous.
# {{label|en|by extension}} An event where people are encouraged to dress in the clothes of another sex, even if they would normally not.

